• date – identify the day / month (filter January‑March 2017, derive month).  
• hits           – repeated field that stores every hit of the session (to be UNNESTed).  
• hits.eCommerceAction.action_type – tells the product‑action that happened in the hit.  
        2 = product detail view (denominator)  
        3 = add‑to‑cart (numerator 1)  
        6 = completed purchase (numerator 2)  
• hits.product   – repeated field that stores every product that belongs to the hit (to be UNNESTed).  
• hits.product.isImpression – TRUE when the product is only an “impression” shown in a list;  
  we have to exclude these rows when counting “real” actions:  
  WHERE ( hits.product.isImpression IS NULL OR hits.product.isImpression = FALSE )  
• _TABLE_SUFFIX – helps to wildcard all daily tables that belong to Jan‑Mar 2017  
  WHERE _TABLE_SUFFIX BETWEEN '20170101' AND '20170331'  

